&s=f97369e82367c2f78d9e1f14c5fb6dbb 3x"}, "body": "Hi! I like your work and would love it if you could depict the Vtuber Raki Kazuki. She's a sweet, comfy, and clumsy raccoon witch.\n\nPlease draw her full body, but otherwise in whatever pose you wish. Whether or not she's wearing her hat is up to you as well. \n\nThis may be posted on Twitter and YouTube.\n\nThanks so much!\n\nReferences: \nhttps://x.com/RakiKazuki/status/1672042864228835328\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/eft98y.png\n\nThe outfit in the following reference image is wrong, but I love the proportions and facial expression.\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/tan643.jpg", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@chitose_meguru/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3152267, "client_id": 3335166, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/919e0df2/uploads/origins/7b41e462-26b6-47f1-91f2-cf7d1e927403?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e4d7cb54834472ffee296d152aaeb547", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/919e0df2/uploads/origins/7b41e462-26b6-47f1-91f2-cf7d1e927403?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e4d7cb54834472ffee296d152aaeb547, https://si.imgix.net/919e0df2/uploads/origins/7b41e462-26b6-47f1-91f2-cf7d1e927403?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eb00855c9b49efc727f5d47cc96cf3f6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/919e0df2/uploads/origins/7b41e462-26b6-47f1-91f2-cf7d1e927403?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e5f6966c49e925488ee9073342c16f68 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/919e0df2/uploads/origins/7b41e462-26b6-47f1-91f2-cf7d1e927403?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c2d325df